mixin forgot_password_form(emailURL = 'https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#inbox')
  include ./form-input.pug
  .form__wrapper
    include ../components/returnBackButton
    h2.form__title.forgot-password-form__title
      | Восстановление пароля
    form.form(name='confirm-email')
      label.form__label
        span.form__input-title Введите email
        +form_input('email', 'email', 'email')
      button.button.form__button.button_color_green(type="submit" name="submit") Отправить письмо
